{"id":"gymnase","lemma":"gymnase","pos":"noun","rank":4774,"glosses":["gym, sports hall"],"ipa":"/ʒim.naz/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-VictorDtmtc-gymnase.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-VictorDtmtc-gymnase.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"gymnases"},"examples":[{"text":"J'étais au gymnase.","en":"I was in the gym.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Où se trouve le gymnase ?","en":"Where is the gymnasium?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to find","l":"trouver"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'attendrai dans le gymnase.","en":"I'll wait in the gym.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons joué au basket dans le gymnase.","en":"We played basketball in the gym.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to play","l":"jouer"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"basketball"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Allons au gymnase et faisons quelques paniers.","en":"Let's go to the gym and shoot some hoops.","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"some","l":"quelque"},{"g":"basket","l":"panier"}]}]}